  "outcome": "passed",
  "conclusion": "The exact codec can refuse duplicate keys through a Decoder subclass and needs its trailing-data, depth and error-type behaviour contained at one owner. The native rapidjson validator cannot check the Draft 7 wire contracts. Python and PostgreSQL read the same schemas differently unless the schemas name their dialect and avoid the listed constructs. pydantic's JSON parser loses decimal scale and digits for JSON numbers. Which values production paths carry is outside these probes.",
